@GeminiMockApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### List models
GET {{GeminiMockApi_HostAddress}}/v1beta/models
Accept: application/json

### Generate content (normal)
POST {{GeminiMockApi_HostAddress}}/v1beta/models/gemini-mock-turbo:generateContent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": [ { "role": "user", "parts": [ { "text": "hello" } ] } ]
}

### Simulate a 429 rate limit (with RetryInfo)
POST {{GeminiMockApi_HostAddress}}/v1beta/models/gemini-mock-turbo:generateContent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": [ { "role": "user", "parts": [ { "text": "simulate:429" } ] } ]
}

### Simulate a 503 overload
POST {{GeminiMockApi_HostAddress}}/v1beta/models/gemini-mock-turbo:generateContent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": [ { "role": "user", "parts": [ { "text": "simulate:503" } ] } ]
}

###
